# Not published yet. The measurement records and the architectural decisions are held back
# from this remote for now -- they are the research layer, and the code stands without them.
# Both are read at runtime by the MCP server (etalon://findings, etalon://decisions), which
# reports their absence rather than failing, and by nothing else. Removing these two lines
# and committing the directories is all it takes to publish them.
/findings/
/docs/adr/
